---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { highlightCode } from '../lib/markdown';
const host = Astro.request.headers.get('x-forwarded-host') || Astro.request.headers.get('host') || Astro.url.host;
const scheme = Astro.request.headers.get('x-forwarded-proto') === 'https' ? 'https:' : Astro.url.protocol;
const remote = `${scheme}//${host}/git/content.git`;
const cloneCommand = `git clone ${remote} my-articles`;
const publishCommands = `cd my-articles
# 编辑 index.toml 和 posts/first/main.md
git add index.toml posts/first
git commit -m 'Publish article'
git push -u origin main`;
const indexExample = `[[articles]]
id = "first"
folder = "posts/first"
title = "第一篇文章"
description = "文章简介"
tags = ["随笔"]
public = true
# entry = "main.md"`;

---
<Base title="账户">
  <div class="account-shell">
    <header class="page-heading"><h1>账户</h1><p id="account-status" role="status">正在读取账户…</p></header>
    <div id="account-content" hidden>
      <div class="account-identity"><div><strong id="account-name"></strong><span class="role-label" id="account-role"></span></div><button id="logout" class="button button-quiet" type="button">退出登录</button></div>
      <section class="settings-section" aria-labelledby="publishing-heading">
        <h2 id="publishing-heading">从本地发布文章</h2>
        <div class="prose publishing-guide">
          <p>获得管理员授权后，你可以通过 HTTPS 克隆个人文章仓库。Git 会提示输入网站用户名和密码，系统凭据管理器可以保存登录凭据。</p>
          <p id="publish-status"></p>
          <ol>
            <li>
              <p>克隆个人仓库。同一个链接会根据认证账号连接到各自独立的仓库。密码通过 Git 的凭据提示窗口输入。</p>
              <pre><code class="language-bash" set:html={highlightCode(cloneCommand, 'bash')} /></pre>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p>进入仓库目录，在 <code>posts/first/main.md</code> 中编写正文，在仓库根目录创建 <code>index.toml</code>。完成编辑后，提交并推送。</p>
              <pre><code class="language-bash" set:html={highlightCode(publishCommands, 'bash')} /></pre>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <details>
            <summary>查看 index.toml 示例</summary>
            <pre><code class="language-toml" set:html={highlightCode(indexExample, 'toml')} /></pre>
            <p>作者和时间由系统生成。入口文档默认为 <code>main.md</code>，正文使用普通 Markdown，文章元信息集中写在 <code>index.toml</code> 中。</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="settings-section" aria-labelledby="password-heading"><h2 id="password-heading">修改密码</h2><form id="password-form"><label for="old-password">原密码</label><input id="old-password" type="password" name="old_password" autocomplete="current-password" required minlength="6" maxlength="256" /><label for="new-password">新密码</label><input id="new-password" type="password" name="new_password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="6" maxlength="256" /><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="button button-quiet" type="submit">修改密码</button></form></section>

    </div>
    <noscript><p class="notice">账户设置需要启用 JavaScript。</p></noscript>
  </div>
</Base>
